{"last_link_id": 263, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["**Original Songbloom**\n```\ncfg_coef: 1.5\ntemperature: 0.90\ndiff_temp: 0.95\nsteps: 36\ntop_k: 100\nsampler: discrete_euler\n```\n\n**My personal preset**\n```\ncfg_coef: 1.3\ntemperature: 1.05\ndiff_temp: 0.90\nsteps: 25\ntop_k: 150\nsampler: spiral\n```"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Suggestions", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [330, 510], "pos": [1490, -740], "id": 125, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["## Installation\n1. Clone the repository to your custom_nodes folder:\n  ```\n  git clone https://github.com/fredconex/ComfyUI-SongBloom.git\n  cd ComfyUI-SongBloom\n  ```\n2. Install dependencies(Use the correct path for your comfyui portable):\n  ```\n  C:\\ai_stuff\\ComfyUI_windows_portable\\python_embeded\\python.exe -m pip install -r requirements.txt\n  ```\nOR if you want to use Chinese!\n  ```\n  C:\\ai_stuff\\ComfyUI_windows_portable\\python_embeded\\python.exe -m pip install -r requirements_chinese.txt\n  ```\n\n***Download to \"ComfyUI/models/checkpoints\":***<br> \n[songbloom_full_150s.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/fredconex/SongBloom-safetensors/blob/main/songbloom_full_150s.safetensors)\n\n\n**Lyric Format**<br>\n(You can ask GPT with the following prompt, please customize the content based on your requirements and double-check the generated lyrics)<br>\nPlease help me write original lyrics, which meet the following requirements:<br>\nThe lyrics contain both vocal and non-vocal sections. Vocal sections must contain a structure flag and lyric text, while non-vocal sections contain only structure flag;<br><br>\n***[verse] / [chorus] / [bridge]*** is prepended to each vocal section, indicating the structure of vocal ragion;<br><br>\n***[intro] / [inst] / [outro]*** is used to fulfill the non-vocal section (optional). The structure flag will be repeated based on the duration of non-vocal section (eg., 5-second intro, then [intro] × 5). Short non-vocal sections can be ignored;<br><br>\nFor lyric text, \".\" is used to separate each sentence."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Instructions", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [1180, 390], "pos": [300, -740], "id": 114, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 261, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SoundFlow_PreviewAudio", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [250, 150], "pos": [1270, -170], "id": 37, "properties": {"duration": 100.48, "currentTime": 0, "volume": 1, "audioUrl": "/view?filename=soundflow_preview_audio_bbe1efc2-f720-49fd-b237-de002c9af496_00001_uohna_1758972719.flac&type=temp&subfolder=&rand=0.797075645788224&Rh-Comfy-Auth=eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI4ZjBhY2Y5ODA3NTczZGI1MDcwMzE4YzFmZWNlMWYwMCIsInNpZ25FeHBpcmUiOjE3NTk1NzczMzY2NzksInRzIjoxNzU4OTcyNTM2Njc5LCJzaWduIjoiYTQ3MDFhYjAzOGExYTc1MDk1Y2Q5NmFkMmYxNGM1NDIifQ==&Rh-Identify=8f0acf9807573db5070318c1fece1f00", "isPlaying": false, "autoSeek": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "node_id": "bbe1efc2-f720-49fd-b237-de002c9af496"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [151], "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["383d49d49175e6ae5cd0e57f014b86e68d4b352c3ceed56380880c5370c54b88.mp3", null, null], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "audio"}, "name": "audio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "音频UI"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "type": "AUDIOUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadAudio", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [270, 136], "pos": [300, -120], "id": 3, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.41"